## Testing Scenarios

### Scenario 1: Single User, Single Browser
```
User opens app → No session
User submits form → Creates sessionId: abc-123
User navigates to analytics → Uses sessionId: abc-123
User submits new form → Creates new sessionId: def-456
```

### Scenario 2: Single User, Multiple Browser Tabs
```
Tab 1: Form submission → sessionId: abc-123
Tab 2: Form submission → sessionId: def-456
Tab 3: Form submission → sessionId: ghi-789
Each tab operates independently
```

### Scenario 3: Multiple Users, Different Browsers
```
User A (Chrome): sessionId: abc-123
User B (Firefox): sessionId: def-456
User C (Safari): sessionId: ghi-789
Complete isolation between users
```

